# boxes: one thing with named parts. good for players, enemies, items.

me has player box name "grok" health 100 club no

me can hit who amount
    health of who lose amount
    say name of who + " get hit. health now " + health of who
    if health of who is small or same 0
        say name of who + " is down!"

me can pick_up who thing
    item thing of who is yes
    say name of who + " pick up " + thing

say player
me hit player 30
me pick_up player "club"
say "has club? " + club of player

# boxes inside a list: a team
me has team list player (box name "zug" health 50 club no)
each fighter in team
    me hit fighter 60

say team
